  "body": "Unlock the ultimate Half Moon Bay lifestyle with this classic, rock-solid family home. Nestled on a generous 760sqm freehold section, 25 Jillteresa Crescent combines immediate comfort, an enviable coastal location, and immense future potential.\r\n\r\nConstructed with time-tested single-level brick and tile, this beautifully laid-out home is perfect for growing families, investors, or land-bankers looking to secure a foothold in one of East Auckland's most prestigious pockets.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n  - Spacious Living: A solid brick-and-tile home featuring four bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a master ensuite.\r\n  - Functional Design: Separate lounge and dining areas provide flexible spaces for both formal hosting and family relaxation.\r\n  - Convenience: Includes a double internal-access garage and ample off-street parking.\r\n  - Development Potential: The flat-to-gently-sloping 760sqm section offers significant upside for future development (subject to council approval).\r\n\r\nThe Location:\r\n\r\nThis home is ideally located minutes from the Half Moon Bay Marina, offering easy access to dining, shopping, and the ferry service to Auckland CBD. Residents can also enjoy proximity to Bucklands Beach and Eastern Beach.\r\n\r\nTop-Tier Schooling:\r\n\r\nThe property is zoned for some of East Auckland’s most sought-after schools:\r\n\r\n  - Macleans College\r\n  - Bucklands Beach Intermediate (BBI)\r\n  - Pigeon Mountain Primary School (PMPS)\r\n\r\nWhether you are looking for a coastal family home or a blue-chip land investment, this property is a must-see. Please contact us today to arrange a private viewing or to receive information regarding our upcoming open homes.",
